======

This repository documents an NFC spool-tagging pipeline for
[Spoolman](https://github.com/Donkie/Spoolman), a Klipper/[Moonraker](https://github.com/Arksine/moonraker)
printer and Home Assistant. It is **not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
supported by** any vendor or project named here — Spoolman, Klipper, Moonraker,
Home Assistant, ESPHome, NXP (NTAG/PN532), Comgrow, Sovol or FlashForge.

No vendor firmware is distributed here
---------------------------------------

This repository contains no firmware from any manufacturer. What it ships is an
ESPHome configuration for a generic ESP32-C3 and a set of Home Assistant
automations — all original work, provided to enable interoperability (tracking
filament spools from Home Assistant).

